{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "GEN",
  "chapter": 35,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God said to Jacob, Arise, go up to Beth-el, and dwell there: and make there an altar to God, who appeared to thee when thou fleddest from the face of Esau thy brother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Jacob said to his household, and to all that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with him, Put away the strange gods that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among you, and be clean, and change your garments:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And let us arise, and go up to Beth-el; and I will make there an altar to God, who answered me in the day of my distress, and was with me in the way which I went.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they gave to Jacob all the strange gods which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in their hand, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ear-rings which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in their ears; and Jacob hid them under the oak which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by Shechem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed: and the terror of God was on the cities that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " round them, and they did not pursue after the sons of Jacob.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So Jacob came to Luz, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the land of Canaan (that is Beth-el) he and all the people that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he erected there an altar, and called the place El-beth-el; because there God appeared to him, when he fled from the face of his brother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But Deborah, Rebekah's nurse, died, and she was buried beneath Beth-el, under an oak: and the name of it was called Allon-bachuth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God appeared to Jacob again when he came out of Padan-aram; and blessed him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God said to him, Thy name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jacob: thy name shall not be called any more Jacob, but Israel shall be thy name; and he called his name Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God said to him, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God Almighty: be fruitful and multiply; a nation and a multitude of nations shall spring from thee, and kings shall come out of thy loins.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the land which I gave to Abraham and Isaac, to thee I will give it, and to thy seed after thee will I give the land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God went up from him, in the place where he talked with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob set up a pillar in the place where he talked with him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a pillar of stone: and he poured a drink-offering thereon, and he poured oil thereon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob called the name of the place where God spoke with him, Beth-el.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Beth-el; and there was but a little way to come to Ephrath: and Rachel travailed, and she had hard labor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass when she was in hard labor, that the midwife said to her, Fear not; thou shalt have this son also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass as her soul was in departing (for she died) that she called his name Ben-oni: but his father called him Benjamin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Rachel died, and was buried in the way to Ephrath, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Beth-lehem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob set a pillar on her grave: that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the pillar of Rachel's grave to this day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Israel journeyed, and spread his tent beyond the tower of Edar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when Israel dwelt in that land, that Reuben went and lay with Bilhah his father's concubine: and Israel heard ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Now the sons of Jacob were twelve:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Leah; Reuben, Jacob's first-born, and Simeon, and Levi, and Judah, and Issachar, and Zebulun:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Rachel; Joseph, and Benjamin:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Bilhah, Rachel's handmaid; Dan, and Naphtali:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Zilpah, Leah's handmaid; Gad, and Asher. These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Jacob, who were born to him in Padan-aram.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob came to Isaac his father to Mamre, to the city of Arbah (which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Hebron) where Abraham and Isaac sojourned.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the days of Isaac were a hundred and eighty years.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.35.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.35.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Isaac expired and died, and was gathered to his people, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "being",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " old and full of days; and his sons Esau and Jacob buried him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
